	(text "MCU\nESP32-A1S: the codec's I2C (GPIO32/33) and I2S (25/26/27/35, MCLK 0) are inside\nthe module. MIC/LINEIN/HBIAS/MBIAS pads unused.\nStraps: GPIO12 low at reset (R107), GPIO15 high (R104), GPIO2 low/floating\n(STDBY via diode on the Power sheet), GPIO0 Boot / auto-reset.\nR105/R106: fit 4.7k only for an I2C OLED (SCL 14 / SDA 13), leave off for SPI.\nCHRG (4) / STDBY (2): internal pull-ups in the firmware.\nC101/C102 next to pad 2 (3V3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140 160 0)
		(effects
